1328..1404 Comment "/// The presented integers as a model of the shape: `base` zero, a value, as"
1405..1482 Comment "/// the theory\'s `base : Pt` is a constant; `turn` the successor and `unturn`"
1483..1560 Comment "/// the predecessor. Each law is proved by `here`: conversion reads the inner"
1561..1637 Comment "/// call under the constructor the outer one builds, and the integers\' rules"
1638..1658 Comment "/// cancel the pair."
